# A fork of com.unity.entities 1.4.8 for the Blobcheg reference patch.
#
# Baseline: a clean 1.4.8, as it lies in commit 17c0a77fa3dd318dae0154d8ec67d836c8906ca8.
# Apply from the root of the Unity project, the package must already be vendored into Packages/com.unity.entities:
#     git apply --3way Packages/Blobcheg/tools~/entities-patch/com.unity.entities@1.4.8.patch
# Check without applying:  git apply --check <the same path>
#
# Rebuild after editing the fork: tools~/entities-patch/regen.sh <project>

